  "summary": "Gitea tracked-time deletion is not scoped to the requested issue",
  "details": "Gitea versions before 1.25.5 look up tracked-time entries by time ID without scoping the lookup to the issue in the request URL, allowing deletion attempts to target entries from another issue.",
